<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="Exam-1-Review">
  <title>Exam 1 Review</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      Use the following problems to prepare for the exam.
      There will be in-class review on Thursday, February 12.
      Your recitation this week will also be exam review.
    </p>

    <p>
      You may bring a standard 3 in x 5 in index card with prepared notes.
      You may use both sides of the notecard.
      You must put your full name in the top right corner of the card, and turn it in along with your exam.
    </p>
  </introduction>


